==Skeleton monkeys==
[[Skeleton (Ape Atoll)|Skeleton monkeys]] can be found in the [[Ape Atoll Dungeon]]. As the dungeon is a multicombat zone and the skeletons respawn rapidly due to their bone drops reanimating, they can be trained on with [[Multicombat_area#Area-of-effect_attacks|area of effect attacks]] like [[chinchompa]]s or [[Ancient Magicks]] burst or barrage spells.
